.DS_Store
.vs

debug/
coverage/

.vscode/**
!.vscode/launch.json
!.vscode/settings.json


**/*/.DS_Store
# Cargo.lock IS tracked. This repository's published results are timing
# measurements of field and curve arithmetic; an untracked lockfile lets
# dependency resolution drift between clones and silently moves them.
# (Workspace members do not have their own lockfiles.)
**/*.rs.bk

**/target

**/*.log
**/*.profraw

.idea/**
*.iml

/artifacts/
# Generated SRS artifacts — derived from setup_seed + kzh_k, regeneratable,
# and far too large for git (multi-GB binary files).
bench-results/srs/

# Divan-fork JSON output: every `cargo bench` run drops one of these in
# the crate root, named after the bench binary. Regeneratable, noisy.
akd/*.json
akd_core/*.json

# Logs from crashed/killed cluster runs. The JSON result files in
# bench-results/ are the actual data and stay tracked; these are multi-MB
# console dumps from runs that did not finish, and they embed the operator's
# home directory paths.
bench-results/*.log.v*-killed
bench-results/*.log.v*-up-failed
